If you run:

    subbins = readr::read_csv('subset.csv')
    library(ez)
    ezDesign(
        data = subbins
        , x = Anteriority
        , y = Laterality
        , col = bin
    )

You get:

Showing that you don't have data for all combinations of the 3 variables, which is necessary for a witihin-Ss anova.

